--- Project Factor Analysis ---
The following factors matter most to project cost and performance:
 - Culture
 - Criticality
 - Criticality Modifier
 - Dynamism
 - Size

You can safely stop worrying about these factors:
 - Initial Known
 - Inter-Dependency
 - Plan
 - Team Size

Analysis: Factors that significantly differentiate the best-performing
setups from the worst-performing ones are the primary drivers of cost.

